  unitName: Sacred Flame Lava
  unitId: 10125
  unitNumber: 441
  description: An elite swordswoman from a top-secret project in the Agni Empire.
    Gravely injured in the battle with the gods, the emperor of the Agni Empire bestowed
    her with wings. As she tried to rest, having finished her duties, a new fire
    began to burn inside her. It was a feeling that was new to her. In an instant,
    the growing flames renewed her wings, inviting her back to the battlefield.
  summonDesc: I can't stop this burning<br>feeling coming from inside me.<br>Accept
    my burning flames!
  fusionDesc: My flames are my soul.<br>They will never go out,<br>even if my life
    should end!
  evoDesc: My bond with him has<br>granted me new wings.<br>Let us take to the sky!
  element: 1
  rarity: 5
